#: includes/features/class-seoprostack-brand-icons.php:68
msgid "A Brand icon block with about 3,800 brand logos (Simple Icons and Font Awesome), in the brand’s colour or your text colour. Icons are part of the page, so nothing extra loads. The [simple_icon] shortcode and #name# menu titles keep working."
